refused: d213_around_a_dot.cy:6:19, line 6 column 19
 6 |     let $n: i32 = std::math . abs(1);
   |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 fix:  `std::math::abs`
 why:  `std` is grouped with `::`, and `.` after a function is a narrowing (D196)

refused: d213_around_a_dot.cy:6:24, line 6 column 24
 6 |     let $n: i32 = std::math . abs(1);
   |                        ^^^^^^^^^^
 fix:  `math.abs`
 why:  no space goes around `.`, `::`, `%`, `%%` or `@`, so every program reads the same (D213)
 because: d213_around_a_dot.cy:6:19, line 6 column 19
 6 |     let $n: i32 = std::math . abs(1);
   |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
     with `std::math::abs` here, this error goes away
